'''Yurinchi''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.3 Update|Version 3.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]] improves health, speed, range and attack rate.

