|name3 = Gekirinchi
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Phoenix Yurinchi''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Gekirinchi''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Yurinchi is a very solid midranger with high HP, good DPS for his range, and generally being a reliable attacker. However, he is held back by his cooldown: a whopping '''[54 seconds]'''. This is a ridiculous number for a super rare, and means his damage output is easily overshadowed by simply stacking midrangers such as Paris Cat and Drama Cats.

However, his usage isn't being spammable midrange attacker. You can think of Yurinchi as an uber with insanely high mobility, as he carries 81,600 HP and 4,500 DPS against angels. This means that against angels, he has the DPS of the average uber rare cat, along with unusually high health. With this taken into consideration, having a 1,875 cost and a 54 second cooldown is extremely good. He has good compatibility against angels too, as he can outrange most of them and his fast attack rate means that it's not too punishing if he misses an attack. While his range is shorter than most ubers, he makes up for this with his high health, which when paired with his four knockbacks, makes his survivability amazing.

While he does have weaknesses such as having bad generalist usage, Yurinchi is still a very valuable unit to have, especially since there are very few anti-angel attackers that can be easily obtained early game.

